#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:5 0f40bc4904bb4af28990b7c62e2aa07b
#: 1a59880837cc4cec85537c132f631de0 37dbf67a7b9e496c8daeafb173cade07
#: b4bd997baff540ab8d4feae0ce3d452a d49ab16f614d4f568392d4f6b04eb75c
msgid "ESC (Electronic Speed Controls)"
msgstr "ESC（电子调速器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:7 05b2c8fd3f5542bf8e2498e9c14cdbeb
#: 07af7341b6ea471d8f6ea694ddc8274c 2adccffd69b8403b9724ca0d8daf8172
#: 80c53b753b204b859e581b214a41dc71 b4d02013fd62420d9ee57b28076c9b54
msgid ""
"ESCs are available for either brushed (DC) or brushless (AC) motors. "
":ref:`Brushed motors<common-brushed-motors>` are most commonly used in toy-"
"class planes, multicopters, rovers, boats, and balance bots. Most other "
"larger vehicles use brushless speed controllers."
msgstr ""
"ESC 可用于有刷（直流）或无刷（交流）电机。:ref:`有刷电机<common-brushed-motors>` "
"最常用于玩具级飞机、多旋翼、越野车、船和平衡机器人。大多数其他较大型飞行器使用无刷调速器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:9 041fc78488b2483ba626baf5dece2294
#: 629adbd5c8f3416786bfe88bb76a0d84 80dab52e67e340e3a10c8413851ac825
#: abbd7e33686b49d1957cf96aab680578 fd4c303c4a9245558e4262148e3daf82
msgid ""
"ESCs are available in a confusing array of communication protocols, "
"programming capability, telemetry, and multi unit configurations. Below is a"
" guide to some of the terms and capabilities."
msgstr "ESC 在通信协议、编程能力、数传和多单元配置等方面种类繁多，令人眼花缭乱。以下是对相关术语和功能的说明指南。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:12 0ff8a6448f714db1b85e2d631d5b5b54
#: 2160ee7d58ff4a8cabea26583254e220 5a3e3f4ef30d4a0db48cdfdaeec6a8dc
#: 5acfba92c3f0451791e3ab16391e6431 607fbc79338e4c81b0c11a52976c97fb
msgid "Control Connection To Autopilot"
msgstr "与飞控的控制连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:14 0297588b18c34eee9b194e10fb7519ec
#: 069e1e6b459447849266a534cef25323 0f612fbd34e142f3a47f5bee0161adc3
#: 2bf7018299a74fd9a535b8d0a061ce2a 59f60bfb0d234125b3043ab73e07dc18
msgid ""
"Single signaling wire to autopilot servo/motor output which can use pulse or"
" digital communication protocols"
msgstr "与飞控舵机/电机输出端的单根信号线连接，可使用脉冲或数字通信协议"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:15 17bd58867d1642c398def5acf163f3d7
#: 47b53f55a97e4363a676558063ec7e82 663c78a665814adfb47bc9ba3d78197a
#: b197bdf2f0e846aeba695786c24eb37b b2842b9cdcab440c878b7fa46852a2b6
msgid ""
":ref:`DroneCAN <common-uavcan-escs>` or CAN, which provides a more robust "
"connection with greater length limits at the expense of more wiring."
msgstr ""
":ref:`DroneCAN <common-uavcan-escs>` 或 CAN，提供更可靠的连接，支持更长的线缆距离，但代价是接线更复杂。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:18 1e568d9b337440d9a9642ee1125ff89c
#: 321304937d184c1494b0c1c47a033976 53a666d11f1547db96d8c02c5f556f9b
#: 9eb65fda7196444c99da1a238e567ca1 d1084d5d1690413d80d80766cd8b972b
msgid "Communication Protocols"
msgstr "通信协议"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:20 07d8d0b09a7c41f2910784a294c9e81a
#: 250a2b48327d42d4bc3fc3adcc7e478d 5263d5375da84afd8205c4b83670a91a
#: b908369704d441be8073f52611a8842b fdb01d5d06684a15b8fbc016a23c9bad
msgid "The ESC may be compatible with one or more of the following protocols:"
msgstr "ESC 可能兼容以下一种或多种协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:22 079048f8249e456f95f7c9f34a524b25
#: 14485d5adc804304ba544f97e70c6da1 267a9251f3a34a798ce54d5be649a63f
#: 6d30d28cfd97432b90646520f008c7d3 985c90760e844ee5a7db6034c3255a32
msgid ""
":ref:`PWM, OneShot, OneShot125<common-brushless-escs>` are pulse based "
"protocols. Almost all ESCs are compatible with PWM signaling. And this is "
"the default configuration of ArduPilot firmware for servo/motor outputs."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PWM、OneShot、OneShot125<common-brushless-escs>` 均为基于脉冲的协议。几乎所有 ESC 都兼容 "
"PWM 信号，这也是 ArduPilot 固件舵机/电机输出的默认配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:23 07eb54a9a12648c2adab4ba70356b13d
#: 2aed0cb024194a1380ac283421e84bbf 5496e5b6f61f4b1b80cc4df6a07d814e
#: 8c94093a1f424664852c631ef1e7505a a986c82636824624b0e23a58c689a789
msgid ""
":ref:`DShot<common-dshot-escs>` is a digital protocol in which the speed is "
"encoded as digital commands to the ESC. Speed of the signaling can be "
"DShot150, DShot300, etc. depending on the ESC's capability. Other ESC "
"commands for ESC led control, etc. can be sent to the ESC if it has the "
"capability."
msgstr ""
":ref:`DShot<common-dshot-escs>` 是一种数字协议，速度以数字命令方式发送给 ESC。信号速率可以是 "
"DShot150、DShot300 等，取决于 ESC 的能力。如果 ESC 支持，还可以向其发送 ESC LED 控制等其他 ESC 命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:24 27abe2c7a3784850a1e55f9005b0da81
#: 2bd9dff9fe584924bf02b72f7c5423d0 75a1687438fe420e89fa5529436fc35c
#: cdc06f6045524e8fba4f8cdbe2bcb81c e19dbb23055e49e5ab71cbfa375de759
msgid ""
":ref:`Bi-Directional DShot<bidir-dshot>` is a variation of Dshot that allows"
" the ESC to return to the autopilot telemetry data. What type of data is ESC"
" dependent. Sometimes referred to as BDShot."
msgstr ""
":ref:`双向 DShot<bidir-dshot>` 是 DShot 的一个变体，允许 ESC 向飞控返回数传数据。返回的数据类型取决于具体 "
"ESC，有时也称为 BDShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:25 18faca45fc0c454cb44c24f17ea9b14d
#: 485256e14f494a6a9ccd317662b9fca4 94fa8627e67c406cb356078ecf8d282b
#: 98403d6a192d4cdba007fb0778dba334 df32fe2bdced4c3bb192eeedfb976379
msgid ""
":ref:`FETtec OneWire<common-fettec-onewire>` ESC is another bi-directional "
"protocol that sends speed commands and returns telemetry."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FETtec OneWire<common-fettec-onewire>` ESC 是另一种双向协议，可发送转速命令并返回数传数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:28 1cb60718e8d54a51b589881c2f8d6efc
#: da4b43a185c148ec83d38d7677b83a57 eb0ec10354444029a206f1b59569873b
#: eb45fcf7d52a4615adb218a7dcd920b2 f9f3cd23103b4a68a1c1aa031d9effa9
msgid "Telemetry"
msgstr "数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:30 01ab7b48e1474a18a4c1929f73f49846
#: 128a9fa95e9c4945b8cf7d7de78669dd 1aeb73ab7dcd4cdb933256c83399cabf
#: c62a08b7367c4aaa8fbf899b3d5d3f9e cfaa022f72e5434facb5252ee2cbabcf
msgid ""
"As stated above some ESCs have the ability to return telemetry from the ESC."
" In addition to the Bi-Directional DShot and FETTec protocols, some "
"DroneCAN/CAN ESCs have this capability. Some ESCs can provide motor RPM "
"telemetry via an additional wire that is connected to the autopilot on one "
"of its UART ports. See :ref:`common-esc-telemetry` for more info."
msgstr ""
"如上所述，某些 ESC 能够从 ESC 端返回数传数据。除双向 DShot 和 FETTec 协议外，部分 DroneCAN/CAN ESC "
"也具备此功能。某些 ESC 可通过额外的导线提供电机转速数传，该导线连接到飞控的某个 UART 端口。详见 :ref:`common-esc-"
"telemetry`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:33 032faab6b4824c2badb09e6920b516ef
#: 151c9fbe20cf4001a07040f5fb087b38 279f42eb7a7b41759e232eccc4722607
#: 624ed937639948fbaedb3a0a243bd827 fc8d3786acc9481fa312abdc7ed856a7
msgid "ESC Programming"
msgstr "ESC 编程"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:35 3e1c6d5dca2e4f6bb4252807a0154417
#: e0b339889e7e47589f4bf8d48c0c9bfd eef30704e7f24721b7ab9f7305827e39
#: f353af2324e045e2a769294d881fad7e f3a759bbeeda4439853dd9395dc2619a
msgid ""
"The ESC sometimes has parameters which can be programmed: timing, motor "
"direction, battery cutoff, startup ramp, etc. Depending on the individual "
"ESC, these can be programmed in different ways:"
msgstr "ESC 有时具有可编程参数：换相时序、电机方向、电池截止、启动斜坡等。根据各 ESC 的不同，编程方式也有所不同："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:37 0a639956eac4478aa91501e6abca0cfd
#: 337df297498a4f0195daaeff9b2e1412 b6d08a15d31a4abba37183d871ff1435
#: d6fc17c9d65944f189c425a68f9f50d7 e210f850aab44fd89f0853a931b95151
msgid ""
"some via a sequence of throttle commands after entering a programming mode "
"upon startup. These vary widely, ESC to ESC."
msgstr "部分 ESC 通过启动时进入编程模式后执行一系列油门命令进行编程，各 ESC 之间差异较大。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:38 141619e7c4cb467db55bbe318894369a
#: 2ebce91426a942619cef080ed06c0189 ad17896d4f164275b215c75c8a4e6342
#: e181e64e510143198e6da4ba37b32743 f6f856cd47f641029e5807314033a067
msgid ""
"some via an interface program like :ref:`BLHeli<common-blheli32-passthru>`."
msgstr "部分 ESC 通过 :ref:`BLHeli<common-blheli32-passthru>` 等接口程序进行编程。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:39 04ac5dfd08b048beb6123afbf195dfab
#: 083aa7041a754beea5714172afbbad0e 5243dc87d39e481a909d94a9181fa189
#: a8d9b56666b64e4d80df869a9f1669da acd62909af1748048b5ecd08679e2c8a
msgid ""
"DroneCAN ESCs via DroneCAN parameters using the :ref:`DroneCAN GUI<common-"
"uavcan-gui>` or Mission Planner's SETUP->Optional Hardware->DroneCAN/UAVCAN "
"setup window to access the parameters."
msgstr ""
"DroneCAN ESC 通过 :ref:`DroneCAN 图形界面<common-uavcan-gui>` 或 Mission Planner "
"的「设置 -> 可选硬件 -> DroneCAN/UAVCAN 设置」窗口来访问参数并进行配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-guide.rst:40 331644005957422cb704484c6e38710c
#: 54e60520a95a4ade9da1bba28759c91d 59cf1d0ea20c4a838cffd0dc207d384e
#: ccfe84f6ee6b45e795bc1950dce61bf9 e846a597ea5946fabe298110415830a0
msgid "some use a supplied setup software program"
msgstr "部分 ESC 使用厂商提供的专用设置软件进行编程"
